<custom_item>
  type                     : AUDIT_POLICY_SUBCATEGORY
  description              : "1.0037 - MSSVR - (L1) Ensure 'Audit Other Policy Change Events' is set to include 'Failure'"
  info                     : "This subcategory contains events about EFS Data Recovery Agent policy changes, changes in Windows Filtering Platform filter, status on Security policy settings updates for local Group Policy settings, Central Access Policy changes, and detailed troubleshooting events for Cryptographic Next Generation (CNG) operations."
  reference                : "NIST 800-53r5|AU-3 AU-3(1) AU-7 AU-12"
