<custom_item>
  type                     : REGISTRY_SETTING
  description              : "1.0151 - MSSVR - (L1) Ensure 'NetBT NodeType configuration' is set to 'Enabled: P-node (recommended)'"
  info                     : "This setting determines which method NetBIOS over TCP/IP (NetBT) uses to register and resolve names."
  reference                : "NIST 800-53r5|CM-1 CM-2 CM-6 CM-7 CM-7(1) CM-9 SA-3 SA-8 SA-10"
