<custom_item>
  type                     : REGISTRY_SETTING
  description              : "1.0205 - MSSVR - (L1) Ensure 'Encryption Oracle Remediation' is set to 'Enabled: Force Updated Clients'"
  info                     : "Some versions of the CredSSP protocol that is used by some applications (such as Remote Desktop Connection) are vulnerable to an encryption oracle attack against the client."
