<custom_item>
  type                     : REGISTRY_SETTING
  description              : "1.0279 - MSSVR - (L1) Ensure 'Network security: Configure encryption types allowed for Kerberos' is set to 'AES128_HMAC_SHA1, AES256_HMAC_SHA1, Future encryption types'"
  info                     : "This policy setting allows you to set the encryption types that Kerberos is allowed to use."
  reference                : "NIST 800-53r5|AC-17(2) IA-5 IA-5(1) SC-8 SC-8(1)"
